<title>CANADA: Armbro Enterprises Inc nine month net off.</title>
<headline>Armbro Enterprises Inc nine month net off.</headline>
<dateline>BRAMPTON, Ontario 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			    1995</p>
<p> Shr			 C$0.80		   C$1.33</p>
<p> Net			  8,032		   13,522</p>
<p> Revs		     167,302		  125,533</p>
<p>	 (All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: 1995 figures include C$8.36 million of non-operating income activities, specifically a C$7.24 million gain from debt forgiveness and a C$1.11 million gain from the sale of an investment.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
